Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.17,0:01:05.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:07.77,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Robi: I don't think this is the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.77,0:01:10.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we going further down?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.47,0:01:12.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We should be climbing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:12.93,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
