Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.02,0:01:19.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Dash, Robi's down here in the ravine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.80,0:01:21.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god.
