Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.77,0:01:38.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:40.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5}This trans girl isn't sorry /j
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.67,0:01:40.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:42.75,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.03,0:01:44.58,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we can freeze people with this snowball.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.83,0:01:47.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, tchhh, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.57,0:01:50.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We're both illumination.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.05,0:01:52.05,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Illuminati
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:53.87,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how does one find food in this pl-
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.25,0:01:55.15,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, on the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.15,0:01:58.20,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,There's an orange crispberry and actually heals you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.20,0:02:01.25,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,No it doesn't heal you. It gives you hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.48,0:02:03.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Heh. It gives you hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:04.68,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Replenishes your hunger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.40,0:02:04.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.05,0:02:07.17,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Yea, GIVES you hunger >:D /s
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.30,0:02:07.33,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,GIVES me hunger??? I don't need hunger. I need to get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:07.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Heheheheheheh
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.95,0:02:10.23,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,It gives you depression. /s
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.10,0:02:11.50,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get RID of it, not get more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.32,0:02:13.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,St- No please. I was-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.83,0:02:18.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I lost valuable extra stamina from you dropping me down like that.
