Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.13,0:02:23.17,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,It's not helping much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:25.35,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going down, going down, going down, going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:25.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Stop holding onto the bugle, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.68,0:02:26.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.52,0:02:28.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Yep. I'm- I'm- I'm- I'm being frozen dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.62,0:02:28.85,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,No, I-
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.85,0:02:30.88,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.88,0:02:30.88,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,You know this place is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.20,0:02:32.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm slightly frostbitten.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.37,0:02:34.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Can you can you come in help me or some- Ah- Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:35.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Urk- Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.92,0:02:36.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm getting up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:39.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I need some warming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.47,0:02:39.15,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Here in time~
