Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.50,0:02:47.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, it's actually very fast. What the hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:48.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
