Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:40.47,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.72,0:04:40.68,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,(I've been) telling you that I'm hungry and need (food)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.07,0:04:42.52,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,My lantern is low!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.52,0:04:43.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You blithering idiot, Alex!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:45.17,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an8}Jeremy Clarkson: Hammond, you blithering idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.43,0:04:46.97,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,You imbecile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.03,0:04:48.75,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.75,0:04:49.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna safely put it in your backpack
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.82,0:04:50.43,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,THat climb here doesn't affect wind by much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.43,0:04:52.05,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not sure how far we could climb (it)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.43,0:04:52.05,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.88,0:04:53.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,to make sure you actually get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.15,0:04:54.37,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I need one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.80,0:04:56.03,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I need one more food.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.78,0:04:58.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Or I could just drop it here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:04:59.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:00.78,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,We can go inside-
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:00.78,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,This one does look convin-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.27,0:05:00.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.58,0:05:02.85,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:03.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I have a hard time trusting the terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.50,0:05:05.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I have a hard time trusting the terrorist now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.45,0:05:06.00,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.57,0:05:08.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:09.17,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Whaddup
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.10,0:05:09.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've assessed this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.88,0:05:10.68,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:11.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh he's up there. He's up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.32,0:05:13.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I have assessed this situation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.50,0:05:14.62,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.98,0:05:16.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and there's nothing I can do to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:19.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,To anyone who have watched Top Gear you know the reference.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.87,0:05:23.55,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,(Terribly covered Jessica [Top Gear Theme])
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:24.33,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You know, the wi-
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:24.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehhahahahahah
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:25.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't reach it at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.03,0:05:25.80,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, barely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.17,0:05:27.07,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Tch- hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.07,0:05:29.40,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna need to sort out this hunger issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.02,0:05:33.70,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.33,0:05:33.93,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.63,0:05:33.93,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, it's already reached past 80%.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.22,0:05:34.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.83,0:05:36.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We just- We just ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:38.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Because there was winterberries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.12,0:05:39.28,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.35,0:05:39.28,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, good for you then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.43,0:05:41.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But only because Robi was very hungry
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.65,0:05:43.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,so we had to deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.30,0:05:43.60,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Some crispy berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.77,0:05:46.00,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, I was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.43,0:05:48.43,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I only had a third of the health bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.63,0:05:50.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You should have told us that you were hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:52.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't know why you couldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.97,0:05:53.47,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I didddddd!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:54.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.47,0:05:55.28,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.87,0:05:56.62,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:57.38,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.08,0:05:57.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake}Heheheheheheheheheheh
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.47,0:05:59.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.37,0:06:00.87,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Not long enough...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:06:00.87,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I did. Nobody listened!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:01.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Heheha
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.87,0:06:02.62,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,You should have aimed down there. Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.62,0:06:03.98,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,You should have aimed down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.85,0:06:04.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.78,0:06:05.87,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't have food bro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.93,0:06:07.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehahahhh hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:09.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. Heheh
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.12,0:06:11.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, on the bright side, I did not nick food from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.82,0:06:13.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike that terrorist up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.53,0:06:14.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.50,0:06:15.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.45,0:06:16.10,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,(Moments before) WHO?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.78,0:06:16.72,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Brian!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.38,0:06:19.20,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I grabbed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:19.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,YOU STOLE MY TWO CRISPBERRIES, DUMBASS
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.20,0:06:20.33,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I grabbed onto it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.15,0:06:22.05,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.62,0:06:22.05,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go~
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:23.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ooo, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Let's climb up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:24.65,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I'm batman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.83,0:06:27.15,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Brian, can you try and catch this rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.87,0:06:27.35,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Wot?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.67,0:06:30.40,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to try and throw it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.53,0:06:31.08,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.20,0:06:37.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Is it even possible to grab onto- oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.77,0:06:39.03,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Yaaaaay~
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.10,0:06:40.67,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.82,0:06:42.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh wow that was a good throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.65,0:06:44.23,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.22,0:06:44.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That was a very good throw. Holy crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.63,0:06:46.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.22,0:06:48.72,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.00,0:06:50.47,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, Brian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.72,0:06:52.93,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh the rope has dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:53.62,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, I dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.60,0:06:55.15,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:56.15,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:56.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh so by the way, I did- I did take notice the fact
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.15,0:06:58.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that you have a Bing Bong in your in your backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.45,0:07:01.65,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I have a Bing Bong in my backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:03.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I assume it's for the achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.90,0:07:04.50,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:06.35,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I already got it though.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:06.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.90,0:07:06.75,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:07.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.50,0:07:07.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:09.10,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Oh nice, you got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.92,0:07:12.48,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,(sea lion noises)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:13.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh it's crazy fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.12,0:07:14.02,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,(sea lion noises)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.82,0:07:15.47,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,(sea lion noises)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.48,0:07:17.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's crazy fast. It's really fast. I'm gonna... I- I- I-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.22,0:07:18.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sayonara.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.13,0:07:19.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Gimme- Gimme a second...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.92,0:07:22.20,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, this is warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.32,0:07:24.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't blow me away. (x4)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.85,0:07:27.83,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You okay you okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.95,0:07:28.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'm chilling. Yeah, I'm chilling here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.20,0:07:30.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good. I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:32.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I just gotta... I just gotta wait for the recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.83,0:07:33.48,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.77,0:07:36.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. Oh. OH! OH! OH!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:36.43,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Now, my hunger bar has already reached the...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.55,0:07:37.85,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:39.47,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. There it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.63,0:07:40.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine, that's fine. I'm fine, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.80,0:07:40.87,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.93,0:07:41.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I just gotta wait-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.17,0:07:44.10,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Local chimpanzee has fallen off the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.62,0:07:44.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I just gotta... I just gotta wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:46.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I just gotta wait for the frostbite to come...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:47.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,To... To go over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.08,0:07:51.55,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh damn. Nothing-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.28,0:07:55.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. I'm safe up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.03,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Literally no food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.72,0:08:02.22,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,If only I can eat this shelf fungus.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.80,0:08:02.63,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.63,0:08:03.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If only I could...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.27,0:08:05.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.50,0:08:06.77,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,(Mysterious Robi noises)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:08.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta get up really quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.78,0:08:10.02,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.70,0:08:10.02,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.27,0:08:10.58,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:11.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.98,0:08:13.50,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody knows who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:14.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tch-hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:17.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no. The winds are back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.50,0:08:20.18,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I'm safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.75,0:08:22.40,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.78,0:08:25.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh. I'm sliding down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:28.77,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I have a really, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.12,0:08:29.83,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:29.83,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,dumb idea...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.03,0:08:31.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh dang. I'm- I'm-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:32.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in stun at this point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.63,0:08:37.70,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,You have a cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:39.62,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.33,0:08:41.43,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I want to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:44.58,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.93,0:08:46.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:50.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,How long are you going for, wind?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.27,0:08:54.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not... I'm not coming back up alive anytime soon at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.73,0:08:55.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:08:56.93,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh there you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:09:01.18,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.53,0:09:01.18,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.33,0:09:02.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, for frick's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:05.63,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.65,0:09:05.63,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,The hu- The hunger doesn't help me at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.82,0:09:07.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, welp. No saving.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.60,0:09:08.25,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Shoot me up-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.47,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Let me... Alright. Let me get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:12.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Welp.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.25,0:09:14.33,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.33,0:09:14.98,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.27,0:09:16.05,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Fire away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:21.72,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:22.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oooh, nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.80,0:09:24.35,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,And... Perfect landing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.00,0:09:25.33,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:25.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Haha niiiice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:27.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Guess how I died by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.25,0:09:28.83,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.08,0:09:29.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Frostbite.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.85,0:09:30.85,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Freezing to death?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:31.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.88,0:09:32.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.85,0:09:34.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Pile of bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:36.03,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.95,0:09:38.05,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Sausage party.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.17,0:09:40.60,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take a chance on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.18,0:09:42.52,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:42.78,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.05,0:09:46.95,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Is he dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.73,0:09:47.18,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.37,0:09:48.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Stop asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.58,0:09:50.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you starting to sound like...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.23,0:09:51.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like... Like Gargamel when he says...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.18,0:09:53.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,(imitating Gargamel) Azreal*? Are you dead?
