Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.60,0:20:45.40,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Send it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.90,0:20:46.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Just-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.75,0:20:46.97,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I'm alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.05,0:20:48.23,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Take what you can
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.97,0:20:49.92,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.23,0:20:49.92,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Because we're in the final stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.10,0:20:49.92,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,This does not look-
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.92,0:20:52.07,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,-is very smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.13,0:20:52.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Final stretch? That's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.22,0:20:54.75,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost in the final stretch
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.92,0:20:57.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've got those spooky black... uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:20:59.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,This spooky black bad omen thing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.30,0:21:02.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,For like 5%, 10%?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.28,0:21:03.27,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we all have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.27,0:21:05.03,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,We all have it when we got revived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.55,0:21:05.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.35,0:21:06.95,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,That's a permanent reduction because you revived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.53,0:21:08.73,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,And I got it from eating-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.95,0:21:11.18,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.73,0:21:11.18,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I got it from eating, cannibalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.55,0:21:13.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehahahah
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.75,0:21:15.40,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Hhh, yea, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.17,0:21:17.62,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I guess we had our spirits lowered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.42,0:21:21.03,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, what can you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:23.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I have chat with me while I was alone back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.23,0:21:25.05,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.48,0:21:25.05,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Where's my scout mints?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.62,0:21:26.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No one pi-
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:26.70,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody took them?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.43,0:21:28.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No one picked up the scout cannon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.58,0:21:30.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But the scout cannons was back there
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.12,0:21:32.88,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, the thick mints.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:34.32,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Someone took them
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.10,0:21:36.17,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,That one?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.53,0:21:38.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Not me
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.97,0:21:39.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.28,0:21:40.05,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.33,0:21:42.53,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the final stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.53,0:21:44.70,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Better climb fast. That's all I can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.82,0:21:48.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,(Reading Russian chat)\NБы уже у вулкана (You're already at the vocano).
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.62,0:21:51.22,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Is it gonna rise as we climb? Oh god...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:53.18,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Your guess is as good as mine
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:56.93,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's gonna endlessly rise
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.93,0:21:58.52,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,and we're gonna die if we don't be quick
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.88,0:22:00.12,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna say anything
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.12,0:22:01.63,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,But you're on the right track
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.18,0:22:03.43,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,(mysterious Robi noises)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.48,0:22:04.22,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,If you want you can use- Oh god
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.22,0:22:06.32,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You want you can use the chain launcher. But, eh
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.10,0:22:08.07,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Good choice
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.75,0:22:10.67,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,And so we can climb across.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.27,0:22:14.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'mma get myself up here
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.58,0:22:15.10,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,(funni European noises)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.35,0:22:16.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Nice
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.50,0:22:17.45,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You go first
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.82,0:22:17.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.42,0:22:19.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.12,0:22:19.13,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.97,0:22:22.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.17,0:22:24.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta start from there
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.43,0:22:26.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Or else I get stuck really easily
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.40,0:22:29.55,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Alright
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.63,0:22:33.48,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,What the-!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.55,0:22:34.00,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.37,0:22:34.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my god-
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.37,0:22:35.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.53,0:22:37.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Grab? Somebody? Reach out? Somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.27,0:22:39.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Help? Somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.13,0:22:41.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh I'm sliding off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:41.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,UwaaaaAAAAAAHHHH!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.02,0:22:43.67,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, OH NO!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.33,0:22:44.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,AHHHHHHHHHHHH
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.65,0:22:46.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,(Tom Cat noises)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.48,0:22:49.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh that was a massive blunder
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.83,0:22:52.85,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,(distant ) Oh, god... The lava rises!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.33,0:22:54.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The lava rises!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.08,0:22:57.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh we're doomed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.95,0:22:59.42,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god dang it
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.53,0:23:02.75,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I grab on to the chain launcher
