Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.77,0:23:06.12,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,While I fell down for some reason
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.53,0:23:19.80,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.02,0:23:19.80,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,My god, this guy is playing, hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.38,0:23:22.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm dead
