Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.55,0:23:38.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Did you grab it by-
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.47,0:23:39.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Did you grab it by the starting end?
