Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.25,0:23:48.90,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.03,0:23:50.60,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,So I'll probably just le-
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.85,0:23:51.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.05,0:23:52.30,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Probably because of my controller
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.15,0:23:52.68,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.68,0:23:53.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I- I slipped
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.15,0:23:55.88,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Because I- I'm not-
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.95,0:23:56.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I slipped because no one reached out and helped me
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.58,0:23:58.60,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I'm trying
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.32,0:24:00.35,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I was too late
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.97,0:24:02.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You were too late, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.42,0:24:03.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I was- I was saying
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.48,0:24:05.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"Can somebody reach out? Somebody?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.08,0:24:06.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And nobody heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.57,0:24:10.33,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Oh jeezus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.77,0:24:10.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Mind if I borrow you as an echo chamber for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.67,0:24:12.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tch-hehehahahahah
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.93,0:24:14.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I am haunting you~
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.28,0:24:15.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oooooohhhh~
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.70,0:24:16.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.35,0:24:18.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But once again, mind if I-
