Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.58,0:24:22.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Alex is fucking speed running
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.32,0:24:25.18,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I sadly gotta go, so like uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.48,0:24:27.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Damn
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.63,0:24:28.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.97,0:24:28.40,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Mmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.58,0:24:29.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck reaching the top
