Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.22,0:24:31.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.68,0:24:33.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You're pretty far
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.92,0:24:34.67,Alex Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta go though, so I'll just uhh..
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.92,0:24:35.82,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, if you see the skies, you're almost there.
