Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.10,0:24:40.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,He had to go
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.47,0:24:42.03,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Damn
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.23,0:24:43.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So RIP, RIP Alex.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.18,0:24:46.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well it's only you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.33,0:24:50.20,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just say you're like...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.53,0:24:51.70,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,I do have a piton, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.20,0:24:52.78,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You're about 70% of the way there
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.78,0:24:53.43,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I can say
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.90,0:24:55.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,(You can see) sunlight, to an extent.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.73,0:24:56.92,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,If you can see the sky-
