Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.92,0:24:59.35,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,(If) you can see most of the sky, you're almost there
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.77,0:25:01.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeap.
