Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.82,0:25:02.68,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.97,0:25:04.53,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Uh
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.33,0:25:07.72,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I don't- Oh, yeah. That can too.
