Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.58,0:25:22.25,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.67,0:25:22.50,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
