Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.97,0:25:27.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.35,0:25:28.45,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... Brian!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.93,0:25:29.58,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,No no no no no
