Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.73,0:25:42.75,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Walls and you, helps you pull others to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.20,0:25:45.58,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, well you guys are more than enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.58,0:25:47.50,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are more than enough to climb through this.
