Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.20,0:25:55.82,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Have faith, have faith. And climb slowly
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.22,0:25:56.02,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
