Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.72,0:26:05.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ok, nevermind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.07,0:26:07.73,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh Brian, watch out~
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.05,0:26:10.67,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,No, no. Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.53,0:26:12.52,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,(unintelligible)
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.05,0:26:14.33,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Good one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.33,0:26:14.83,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,-kay
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.93,0:26:18.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Okay
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.37,0:26:19.98,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Ah-
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.53,0:26:20.18,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Nice nice nice nice
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.63,0:26:21.25,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Safe
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.50,0:26:25.47,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, you're 85% the way there.
