Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.88,0:32:13.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad that we've organized this PEAK stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.12,0:32:15.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And actually reached the ending for real
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.58,0:32:19.37,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,The fact that we actually won with this team is outrageous
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.90,0:32:19.53,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.53,0:32:22.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, yeah. It's insane
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.38,0:32:22.82,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.72,0:32:24.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We've got- We've got a t-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.40,0:32:24.40,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,And I've seen...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.58,0:32:26.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We've got- We've got the- the serious guy
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.02,0:32:28.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And then we've got the...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.75,0:32:29.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Uh
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.10,0:32:31.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The- The- The-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.18,0:32:31.57,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.08,0:32:33.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The troller that locks in when needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.88,0:32:35.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And then we've got...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.27,0:32:36.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The helper, hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.22,0:32:37.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And then
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.27,0:32:39.17,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,(indecipherable)
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.37,0:32:40.35,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,We got the bomber but he's gone
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.12,0:32:40.38,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.93,0:32:40.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The missing- the missing- the-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.20,0:32:41.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehe
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.42,0:32:41.83,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,And then the hoarder
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.77,0:32:43.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We got the missing two. O-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.83,0:32:44.22,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,The hoarder, terrorist, bomber.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.33,0:32:44.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.27,0:32:45.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We got the-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.22,0:32:45.87,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,He goes by many names
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.67,0:32:47.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe. Yep. He goes by many names.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.92,0:32:51.75,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,But most infamously, The Terrorist.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.80,0:32:51.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The traitor. The terrorist. The bomber. The speedrunner.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.17,0:32:52.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,E-Yup
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.28,0:32:55.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, one more missing...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.88,0:32:57.07,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Speedruns, hoards and bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.85,0:32:57.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The forgotten one-
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.37,0:32:58.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The forgotten one, Yannick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.62,0:33:00.62,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh~
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.93,0:33:02.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Please, check him out in the description.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.38,0:33:05.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If I ever linked him either on this VOD, or the highlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.77,0:33:06.42,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I DID forget him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.68,0:33:07.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.72,0:33:08.95,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah. What the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.57,0:33:10.68,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,I actually- I actually DID forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.43,0:33:10.77,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, yeah. What the hell is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.87,0:33:12.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he lost connection. And I tried inviting him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.93,0:33:14.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But he couldn't join or something. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.77,0:33:15.28,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.22,0:33:17.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And he did not DM me about it. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.60,0:33:18.73,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Hehahahahahaha
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.78,0:33:19.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But that aside. That aside, that aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.68,0:33:24.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We got- We got a great team of uhh, "diverse characteristic"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.37,0:33:26.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Made it to the top and umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.88,0:33:29.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, not quite. HALF of us made it to the top. But...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.03,0:33:30.77,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,A diverse crew
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.38,0:33:32.87,Robi Default,,0,0,0,,(chuckle)
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.18,0:33:35.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, a diverse set of c- A diverse group of crew
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.17,0:33:36.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,made it to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.25,0:33:37.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.48,0:33:38.98,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,There's a lo- There's one thing I could do
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.98,0:33:42.53,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I just could've just put the checkpoint flag before going there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.53,0:33:43.05,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Welp...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.12,0:33:44.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.42,0:33:46.77,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,I have a checkpoint (unintelligible).
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.75,0:33:46.77,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Welp, too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.97,0:33:46.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I see
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.22,0:33:47.55,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.67,0:33:50.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I did struggle on the on the forest area (Roots Biome) and...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.58,0:33:51.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And the lava. Those-
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.77,0:33:54.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The lava (Caldera). Those two. Were- Were the hardest for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.92,0:33:56.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from the Mesa biome.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.13,0:33:59.27,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,The only thing that's unfair is the forest biome, to be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.43,0:34:01.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.27,0:34:01.78,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,The other- The others are okay
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.12,0:34:03.35,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,They are manageable
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.68,0:34:05.02,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,The forest one, it just stinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.53,0:34:05.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yup
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.13,0:34:05.12,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.95,0:34:06.25,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Meh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.12,0:34:07.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,To me, the Mesa biome was- was- was- was the-
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.87,0:34:11.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,was the worst. Primarily because of the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.17,0:34:14.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That- that- that- that- hardly recovers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.28,0:34:17.40,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Erm. The Mesa Is manageable
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.88,0:34:19.37,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.40,0:34:19.37,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,if you know how to circumvent the (burn).
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.48,0:34:19.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I mean
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.68,0:34:22.70,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,The biome with the kaktoos (cactus).
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.08,0:34:22.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The important part with the Mesa is to be be-
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.78,0:34:24.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,-is to be able to find...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.45,0:34:24.73,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,And besides- And besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.73,0:34:27.52,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't- You haven't climbed the Mesa biome yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.52,0:34:28.92,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Hhhh- You haven't seen what...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.68,0:34:29.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.92,0:34:30.22,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Heheheheh
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.70,0:34:32.02,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,{\an7}Dasher Cam
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.35,0:34:32.02,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Remember when we all got wiped out by a cactus
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.02,0:34:34.23,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh, are you alive?
