Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.27,0:34:45.97,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,We all got knocked into a cactus and died.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.72,0:34:46.02,Dasher Default,,0,0,0,,Yup
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.35,0:34:46.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Tch- hehehe
