Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.60,0:34:49.70,Chicken Default,,0,0,0,,Tragically.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.23,0:34:49.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,By the toombleweed (tumbleweed).
